  "synopsis": "High in the imperial court, one worries for the common folk; far in the Jianghu, one worries for all under heaven. Having lost his father in childhood, He Fangzhi mastered extraordinary martial arts skills and embarked on a path of vengeance. From a mutton soup shop on the northwestern border where his entire family was exterminated thirteen years ago, to Linqing Prefecture in Shandong, and on to Mount Cuifeng in Zhejiang, He Fangzhi crosses north and south, unraveling threads and peeling layers to uncover the mastermind behind his father's murder. On the road to revenge, He Fangzhi senses that his opponents all seem to be men of honor and deep righteousness—men who appear to be risking everything to protect the true architect of the tragedy...\n\n(Source: Tencent Video, translated):",
